sequenceDiagram
    participant Panel as Home Panel
    participant Core as Home Core
    participant Pi as Raspberry Pi
    participant Internet as HTTPS connectivity probe
    Panel->>Core: GET /v1/system/metrics
    Core->>Pi: Read /proc, statfs and interfaces
    Core->>Internet: HEAD generate_204 (timeout)
    Internet-->>Core: Reachability status
    Core-->>Panel: Snapshot hardware + network
